---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../../../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How Cllr John Morris's office collects, uses, and protects your personal data."
>
  <section class="section legal">
    <div class="container legal__inner prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <h2>Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        This website is run on behalf of {site.name}, {site.role}, {site.council}. For any questions about this
        policy or how your data is handled, contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>When you use this website, we may collect:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Information you submit through the contact, casework, or newsletter sign-up forms (such as your name, email address, home address, and the details of your enquiry).</li>
        <li>Basic technical information needed to operate the site securely.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To respond to your enquiry or casework issue, including, where necessary, raising it with Newham Council or other organisations on your behalf.</li>
        <li>To send you email updates, but only if you've actively opted in via the newsletter sign-up form.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        We keep casework correspondence for as long as reasonably necessary to resolve your issue and for a
        reasonable period afterwards, in case the matter is reopened.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>
      <p>
        Under UK data protection law, you have the right to ask what personal data we hold about you, to have it
        corrected, and in most cases to ask for it to be deleted or for us to stop processing it. To exercise any
        of these rights, contact <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Newsletter sign-up</h2>
      <p>
        We only add you to our email update list if you tick the consent box on the sign-up form. You can
        unsubscribe at any time using the link in any email we send, or by contacting us directly.
      </p>

      <h2>Third parties</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell your personal data. The "Get in touch" contact form and the email sign-up form on this
        site are processed by{' '}
        <a href="https://formspree.io/legal/privacy-policy/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Formspree</a>,
        a third-party form service, in order to deliver your message or sign-up to Cllr Morris's office by
        email.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal__inner {
    max-width: 42rem;
  }
</style>
